use firn/tags

forgejo-cli is a Module
forgejo-cli is tagged development

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.forgejo-cli.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.forgejo-cli]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."forgejo-cli"."enable": enable "Forgejo CLI for repo / issue / CI ops against codeberg + other Forgejo instances"
